# Copy to .dev.vars (for `npm run preview`) and/or .env.local (for `npm run dev`),
# then fill in your key. Create one at https://platform.claude.com (Get API key);
# the chat runs on the Console organisation's credits.
# In production, set it as a Worker secret instead:
#   npx wrangler secret put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key-here
